A below-column marker after a comment, where no paragraph is open

```
- a
  %%%
  x
  %%%
 - s
.
<ul>
  <li>a</li>
  <li>s</li>
</ul>
```

```
- a
  %%%
  x
  %%%
 1. o
.
<ul>
  <li>a</li>
</ul>
<ol>
  <li>o</li>
</ol>
```

```
- a
  %%%
  x
  %%%
 # h
.
<ul>
  <li>a</li>
</ul>
<section id="h">
  <h1>h</h1>
</section>
```

```
- a
  b
 - s
.
<ul>
  <li>a
b</li>
  <li>s</li>
</ul>
```

```
- a
  > q
 - s
.
<ul>
  <li>a
    <blockquote><p>q</p></blockquote>
  </li>
  <li>s</li>
</ul>
```
